Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.03,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:32.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次也教我數學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:35.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那就教我英文之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:40.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次模擬考穩啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,想得美咧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:44.33,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,-拜拜\N-拜啦 佐藤同學
